## 2. robots.txt compliance

The crawler is built to honor each site's `robots.txt` policy. Both
`crawler/deepcrawl.py` and `crawler/completeness.py` (the re-fetch pass) set
`check_robots_txt=True`, so fetches respect each site's robots directives and
crawl-delay. Do not disable this behavior to crawl resources a site has
disallowed.

